{"kind": "node", "eid": "4:690393c0-1fb4-417c-8bb4-da40a23ad3d5:642", "labels": ["Chunk"], "props": {"section_title": "", "embeddingText": "In March 2017, the authorization under the 2012 Share Repurchase Program (2012 Program) was increased to $1.0 billion by the Company's Board of Directors. As of October 31, 2024, $256.4 million remained authorized for repurchase under the program. See Note 8. Stockholders’ Equity for additional information. In fiscal 2024, there were no share repurchases under the 2012 Program.", "source_type": "text", "memory_id": "7f802dd9-b664-4d32-a4e1-c045ec4f7990", "_source_id": "7f802dd9-b664-4d32-a4e1-c045ec4f7990", "id": "7f802dd9-b664-4d32-a4e1-c045ec4f7990_chunk_0000", "_ontology_name": "fibo_syn", "created_at": "2026-08-02T01:35:17.804869+00:00", "char_start": 0, "_workspace_id": "armd-deepseek-c2373adb", "content_preview": "In March 2017, the authorization under the 2012 Share Repurchase Program (2012 Program) was increased to $1.0 billion by the Company's Board of Directors. As of October 31, 2024, $256.4 million remained authorized for repurchase under the program. See Note 8. Stockholders’ Equity for additional information. In fiscal 2024, there were no share repurchases under the 2012 Program.", "token_count": 58, "chunk_id": "7f802dd9-b664-4d32-a4e1-c045ec4f7990_chunk_0000", "_ontology_version": "1.0.0", "_ontology_artifact_hash": "68538ee954710f55", "text": "In March 2017, the authorization under the 2012 Share Repurchase Program (2012 Program) was increased to $1.0 billion by the Company's Board of Directors. As of October 31, 2024, $256.4 million remained authorized for repurchase under the program. See Note 8. Stockholders’ Equity for additional information. In fiscal 2024, there were no share repurchases under the 2012 Program.", "embedding_vector_id": "7f802dd9-b664-4d32-a4e1-c045ec4f7990_chunk_0000", "status": "active", "document_id": "7f802dd9-b664-4d32-a4e1-c045ec4f7990_doc", "source_id": "7f802dd9-b664-4d32-a4e1-c045e